OL,3,GNEWSARain compounds efforts to control
OL,4,AHolme Fen fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire service has said recent spells
OL,7,Fof heavy rain have created "another
OL,8,Fchallenge" for crews tackling a
OL,9,Fpeatland fire which has been burning
OL,10,Ffor nearly a month.
OL,12,FCambridgeshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,13,Fthanked local farmers and organisations
OL,14,Ffor helping them control the blaze at
OL,15,FHolme Fen Nature Reserve, near
OL,16,FPeterborough, which started on 8
OL,17,FAugust.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
