OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSARain compounds efforts to control
OL,4,AHolme Fen fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the service said:
OL,7,F"Whilst the rainfall has raised the
OL,8,Fmoisture content of the peat, it is
OL,9,Fimpacting the ability for heavy
OL,10,Fmachinery to be used to clear the
OL,11,Farea."
OL,13,FYellow weather warnings for lightning
OL,14,Fand heavy rain were issued for parts of
OL,15,Fthe region last week, resulting in
OL,16,Fflash floods in Peterborough.
